  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>LOCKED</Major>
    <Description>This macro performs 3 moves. It looks left, chest traps, then turns back to where you were originally facing. What the macro does is once the ball is in the air and you'd like to chest trap, you can do what is known as fake chest trapping. This is where you chesttrap in the direction away from where you're facing, fooling defenders and preventing most 2nd touches. The original resolution is 1920x1080, as well as 800 dpi and 0.171 sensitivity in ROBLOX, with 0.5 sensitivity in LOCKED.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
